/target

# Recordings made while testing. Scoped to the working root on purpose: the
# README's illustration lives in docs/assets and must be committed.
/*.gif
/*.mp4
/*.webm
/*.mkv

# Screenshots and self-test grabs, same scoping and a sharper reason: these are
# pictures of somebody's screen. AGENTS.md forbids attaching one to a pull
# request, an issue or a commit, and the README has no screenshot for the same
# reason — so the format they arrive in should not be committable from the
# working root by accident. Every tracked image lives in docs/assets.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg

# Python bytecode from scripts/make-demo.py
__pycache__/
*.pyc
